{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在短停留页面上的纵向交替和密集感受词不如X左右分区直观，尤其S01、S05，快速扫读时容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"我选Y，因为它用加亮的关键词明确标出每段心理变化的核心，又用随音乐出现的感受词把情绪变化落实到具体时刻，而不只是给出概括性的情绪标签。尤其S06的想靠近又怕要得太多、S11的彼此需要、S13的幸福中逐渐掺入失去的预感，Y保留了X压缩掉的重要心理层次和因果转折，因此人物动机更容易理解，前后也更像同一段关系不断发展的过程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c4c6b5de-c1f6-46e8-8090-c4481521b59d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022921468375Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:30:28.699892+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c8d481162f908aa3fe66f1d2dc7ffc4afa168c02759b782ac539b797007e93cd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py